{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-208761","runs":[{"text":"Phần truyện độc lập của Lae.\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-208791","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 1 - Dawn vs Shadow:","bold":true},{"text":" The Dawn Vindicators are fighting to save the villagers of a town from knights investigating rumors of a young girl possessed by a malicious spirit ("},{"text":"/join trygve","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/trygve"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-208985","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 2 - Vinidication of Light","bold":true},{"text":": Snap into Dawn Vindicator's stronghold to rescue abducted villagers, staying in shadows to avoid detection. Be vigilant as darkness lurks within the light ("},{"text":"/join neofortress","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dawn-vindicators-fortress"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-209198","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 3 - Twisted by Shadows","bold":true},{"text":": Collaborate with Lae to rescue villagers held captive by Gramiel and his Dawn Vindicators, ascend the NeoTower Fortress, defeat the Elite Priest, and avoid newly formed minions ("},{"text":"/join neotower","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dawn-vindicators-tower"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-209427","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 3.5 - Dawn Sanctum's Light","bold":true},{"text":": His Dawn Vindicator army fights to prove the supremacy of humans, to destroy evil spawned in the wake of monsters, and in the name of... a Hollowborn Minx?! ("},{"text":"/join dawnsanctum","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dawn-vindicators-sanctum"},{"text":")\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-209643","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Chapter 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TRs_-uanyYo"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chapter 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watc